WEBVTT

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:03.480
King Arthur

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:05.430
is the Savior-King!

00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:08.270
I thank you for your final prophecy.

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:10.940
Jeanne?!

00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:15.080
You bastard!

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:19.030
No matter.

00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:23.020
Soon a world full of 
darkness will be created.

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:26.620
And I, too, will live for eternity...

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:28.670
By dissolving into the darkness

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:32.730
and becoming one with the 
world King Arthur will create.

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:38.350
That is your destiny, Nobu.

00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:40.710
As the Destroyer-King,

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:42.620
you will destroy everything close to you,

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.010
and eventually, the world—

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:45.140
Shut up.

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:57.530
The Fool...

00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:18.880
So this is Nobu's...

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:21.080
...the Destroyer-King's power.

00:01:23.310 --> 00:01:25.280
I have been waiting for you.

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:34.190
Oda Nobunaga, the Destroyer-King,
 who will return all to dust and ashes.

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:36.450
And you?

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:39.660
I am Arthur,

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:43.430
the Savior-King,
 who will recreate heaven and earth.

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:52.830
Who knew that the supreme leader

00:01:52.830 --> 00:01:54.720
of the Star of the West
 would be a shriveled old man?

00:01:55.220 --> 00:01:56.640
I see.

00:01:56.640 --> 00:02:00.620
So you can see my true self.

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:02.000
What do you mean?

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:07.720
Not everything appears 
the same way to all men.

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:15.070
Men see through the
 warped lens of their own values.

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:22.350
People see what they want to see,

00:02:22.880 --> 00:02:25.140
and believe what they want to believe.

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:31.510
I simply project those values as they are.

00:02:31.850 --> 00:02:36.590
To some, I am the absolute savior.

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:41.690
To others, I am a pure, holy one.

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:44.560
And yet to some,

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:46.830
I am hope believed lost.

00:02:49.090 --> 00:02:53.180
So once I reveal your trick,
 you're finished.

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:55.140
Do as you wish.

00:02:56.140 --> 00:02:58.680
Everything will soon be decided.

00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:02.140
Even if the truth becomes known,

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:04.750
the flow of events cannot be changed.

00:03:05.390 --> 00:03:06.880
You're just a fraud.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:08.410
No,

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:11.490
I am a mirror that reflects people's desires.

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:15.600
All men cling to some desire as they live.

00:03:16.150 --> 00:03:20.630
I am granting the happiness people desire.

00:03:20.830 --> 00:03:22.140
Yeah, right.

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:25.630
People can only find fulfillment in truth.

00:03:26.090 --> 00:03:29.090
There is no meaning in false happiness!

00:03:30.570 --> 00:03:34.520
I had thought that only da Vinci 
would be capable of rejecting me

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:37.270
and seeing the truth for what it is.

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:40.400
I did not expect there to be another.

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:43.800
Oda Nobunaga,

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:47.330
what do you believe in?

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:50.390
What do you fear?

00:03:52.090 --> 00:03:54.350
I'm nobody special.

00:03:54.910 --> 00:03:57.070
I'm just a fool.

00:03:57.430 --> 00:04:01.100
So you will follow the fool's path, 
as your nature commands.

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:06.440
That may be a source of strength.

00:04:11.780 --> 00:04:13.690
I must save King Arthur.

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:16.080
I will never let destruction happen.

00:04:16.430 --> 00:04:17.990
The ideal world must...

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:26.830
Hideyoshi.

00:04:28.610 --> 00:04:29.760
Damn it.

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:31.430
That bastard!

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:33.000
Mitsu?

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:36.690
Where are you going?

00:04:38.060 --> 00:04:42.050
I'm not as smart as you,

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:47.260
so I don't think I can observe
 and analyze things like you at all.

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:52.720
But I know I can tell
 when somebody intends to kill.

00:04:52.910 --> 00:04:55.260
Mitsu, you're planning to turn that blade

00:04:55.260 --> 00:04:57.450
against Nobu-sama, aren't you?

00:04:57.450 --> 00:04:58.690
And what if I am?

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:01.960
Wrong question!

00:05:03.930 --> 00:05:08.150
I can liberate people

00:05:08.150 --> 00:05:11.520
from fear of death through 
the power of the Holy Grail.

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:15.310
I can guide a new world into being.

00:05:15.310 --> 00:05:16.540
That's stupid.

00:05:17.090 --> 00:05:20.820
That woman's life is fading.

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:25.350
I can save Jeanne Kaguya d'Arc, as well.

00:05:28.630 --> 00:05:33.430
Did you not also come
 here in search of salvation?

00:05:39.050 --> 00:05:40.840
You're right, Jeanne.

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:44.800
If I run away from confronting death

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:46.830
and survive by choosing to serve you,

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:49.580
what kind of life would that be?

00:05:50.150 --> 00:05:52.080
No thanks.

00:05:52.390 --> 00:05:54.160
Then what will you do instead?

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:56.540
Will you die in ignominy,

00:05:56.540 --> 00:06:00.220
unable to save your own life,
 or the one you love?

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.060
That might not be so bad.

00:06:06.830 --> 00:06:08.830
I pride myself on my will.

00:06:09.280 --> 00:06:14.740
I will struggle and rage
 in my life, and then die.

00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:17.580
You great fool...

00:06:20.590 --> 00:06:22.640
Let's do this, Jeanne!

00:06:22.950 --> 00:06:25.460
Let's put the stars in the balance,

00:06:25.460 --> 00:06:30.870
and become the greatest
 fools the world has ever known!

00:06:39.240 --> 00:06:41.310
Da Vinci-san! You're...

00:06:41.310 --> 00:06:44.900
The Last Supper has finally begun.

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:46.510
What are you doing?!

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:48.050
This place won't last much longer!

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:49.950
You're right.

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:52.840
You should get out of here soon, Lady Hiraga.

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:53.970
Are you...

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:59.220
I have neither Giant War Armor,
 nor guns, nor swords.

00:06:59.220 --> 00:07:01.580
What can I fight with as a weapon

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:04.290
and what can I live for?

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:09.820
The answer was already within my grasp.

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:12.390
I can predict the truth of the 
world and draw it into being.

00:07:12.760 --> 00:07:15.030
This is my battle.

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:17.000
I cannot flee.

00:07:20.070 --> 00:07:22.200
If that brush is your weapon,

00:07:22.760 --> 00:07:25.410
my mine is my arms,
 which bear the weight of my expertise.

00:07:25.830 --> 00:07:27.220
Draw, then.

00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:29.210
I'll watch over you until the end.

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:34.220
So, you, also, are as great of a fool as I.

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:38.800
It seems the time has
 come for me to make a decision.

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:43.340
But I already know what that will 
be without even seeing the card.

00:07:43.710 --> 00:07:47.960
The future I will grasp,
 the future the world indicates...

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:52.280
That is Judgement, upright.

00:08:06.530 --> 00:08:09.450
Nobunaga!

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:15.310
Not yet!

00:08:15.310 --> 00:08:18.080
This is not the full extent of my power!

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:23.120
I have already devoured a dragon!

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:25.230
I will devour the world itself, as well!

00:08:34.150 --> 00:08:35.980
Ha, a dragon?!

00:08:35.980 --> 00:08:37.880
You're just a puny lizard!

00:08:40.270 --> 00:08:41.480
I'm not done yet!

00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:44.120
I can't be done!

00:08:46.760 --> 00:08:48.100
Not yet!

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:53.700
This is...

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:56.180
<i>Fool-brat.</i>

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:57.930
<i>You have defeated me.</i>

00:08:57.930 --> 00:09:00.770
<i>I will not allow you to die before you 
gain dominion over heaven and earth.</i>

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:06.370
<i>You must show me where 
your chosen path will end.</i>

00:09:07.110 --> 00:09:08.260
<i>My Betrothed!</i>

00:09:08.260 --> 00:09:11.650
<i>Stand straight and proud!</i>

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:16.390
It's so bright...

00:09:16.900 --> 00:09:17.850
Jeanne...

00:09:18.890 --> 00:09:20.510
So warm.

00:09:20.510 --> 00:09:22.610
This is what it means to be alive.

00:09:23.010 --> 00:09:24.030
Yes.

00:09:24.030 --> 00:09:26.940
Souls that lived life to the fullest,
 until their very last moments,

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:29.260
will give me strength.

00:09:31.030 --> 00:09:33.240
I can still do more.

00:09:34.810 --> 00:09:36.140
More.

00:09:36.140 --> 00:09:38.620
Give me more power!

00:09:40.810 --> 00:09:45.620
Then I shall become the dragon's 
talons that will rend the earth.

00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:50.870
What is that?!

00:09:51.410 --> 00:09:53.320
Stop being distracted!

00:09:58.870 --> 00:10:01.250
Death is a means for men

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:03.770
to link their souls and beliefs, 
entrusting them to the future!

00:10:04.340 --> 00:10:09.630
An immortal body, deprived of death, 
cannot possibly create a future!

00:10:19.380 --> 00:10:23.360
A violent surge of life, capable of 
resurrecting even the souls of the dead...

00:10:24.320 --> 00:10:27.360
The twelve Chosen have finally assembled!

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:35.360
Give life to the new world 
and bring true salvation!

00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:37.370
Appear, Holy Grail!

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:25.990
What's about to happen?

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:44.160
A new... world?

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:46.230
Hideyoshi?!

00:12:47.150 --> 00:12:50.470
Our long-desired salvation is coming.

00:12:51.190 --> 00:12:53.740
The day has finally come to reclaim you.

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:57.650
Come back to life, my beloved!

00:13:09.730 --> 00:13:12.620
In the end, they were just 
monstrous beings for the Holy Grail.

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:16.890
Mitsu!

00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:22.970
Destruction has yet to cease its call,

00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:25.150
despite the appearance of the Holy Grail!

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:25.730
What is this?

00:13:31.840 --> 00:13:33.240
I see...

00:13:33.240 --> 00:13:37.030
You are one who will
 destroy even sacred hope.

00:13:41.950 --> 00:13:43.550
King Arthur! It can't be!

00:13:58.480 --> 00:13:59.640
Hideyoshi...

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:02.070
You shielded me.

00:14:03.910 --> 00:14:05.380
I didn't ask for that!

00:14:05.760 --> 00:14:06.890
Hey...

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:09.610
We swore an oath, didn't we?

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:12.520
That we'll change the world.

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:15.580
That we'll unify heaven and earth.

00:14:17.150 --> 00:14:19.800
So... you know, Mitsu.

00:14:20.240 --> 00:14:22.850
Stop being so lame.

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:25.600
Forget about Arthur.

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:30.760
What good would a nobody like
 him do even if he did rule the world?

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:32.830
We have to...

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:36.440
We have to be the ones to do it!

00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:38.640
Hideyoshi...

00:14:39.570 --> 00:14:41.440
You look terrible.

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:45.150
You're right, Monkey.

00:14:46.920 --> 00:14:49.670
There's no point in hoping 
someone else will do the job.

00:14:51.190 --> 00:14:53.060
Only we can decide our destiny.

00:14:53.470 --> 00:14:56.190
Only this blade will show our future!

00:14:58.170 --> 00:15:00.860
I will strike Nobu down of my own will.

00:15:02.660 --> 00:15:05.350
The enemy is at Honnouji!

00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:08.340
Not yet!

00:15:09.930 --> 00:15:10.840
Nobunaga...

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:14.870
If you choose the path of destruction,

00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:16.580
I can accept that.

00:15:17.570 --> 00:15:19.400
I don't care if you are the Destroyer-King.

00:15:20.170 --> 00:15:21.750
I just want to live my life at your side.

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:38.600
Nobu is now destruction itself.

00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:46.730
Nobu, do you intend to 
destroy all of creation?!

00:15:46.730 --> 00:15:49.150
Indeed. That's not such a bad thing.

00:15:49.610 --> 00:15:52.170
I will continue to fight, and to live.

00:15:52.170 --> 00:15:53.760
I will continue to destroy...

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:56.520
So long as there are
 pointless things that deserve it!

00:15:58.140 --> 00:16:00.860
Weren't we going to change the world?

00:16:00.860 --> 00:16:02.210
I will.

00:16:02.210 --> 00:16:04.180
Once I destroy everything,

00:16:04.180 --> 00:16:06.210
it will be a brand-new world,
 full of dancing flames.

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:07.920
But what about unifying heaven and earth?!

00:16:07.920 --> 00:16:09.100
What about our vow?!

00:16:12.260 --> 00:16:13.430
Oh?

00:16:13.970 --> 00:16:17.940
Then I'll destroy unification itself.

00:16:18.610 --> 00:16:19.710
The hell you will!

00:16:19.710 --> 00:16:21.610
Destroy unification itself?!

00:16:21.610 --> 00:16:25.170
What about Hideyoshi,
 who believed that you would succeed?

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:26.170
What about me?

00:16:26.650 --> 00:16:28.410
I won't let you destroy it.

00:16:28.990 --> 00:16:30.540
The ones who'll change the world...

00:16:31.040 --> 00:16:33.290
The ones who'll unify 
heaven and earth are us!

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:38.760
If you aren't the one who'll do it, Nobu...

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:43.730
I will defeat you and do it, myself!

00:16:44.390 --> 00:16:45.570
Achieve unification!

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:48.440
Now that's a thought.

00:16:53.510 --> 00:16:54.620
Nobunaga...

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:56.180
Mitsuhide...

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:04.260
Let it begin.

00:17:04.260 --> 00:17:05.620
Right now.

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:06.710
A duel!

00:17:19.450 --> 00:17:21.300
Rule over heaven and earth?

00:17:21.300 --> 00:17:22.500
You?

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:24.370
Ludicrous!

00:17:27.380 --> 00:17:28.550
Do you have

00:17:28.550 --> 00:17:32.010
the will to stand above men 
and bear the weight of it all?

00:17:32.010 --> 00:17:35.320
Do you have the capacity?!

00:17:45.780 --> 00:17:48.780
Mitsu, do you have the resolve?

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:53.560
Answer me, Akechi Mitsuhide!

00:17:53.560 --> 00:17:55.170
As if that is even a question!

00:18:01.510 --> 00:18:03.970
Is that the truth of this world?

00:18:05.440 --> 00:18:09.890
Will Mitsuhide-dono kill Nobunaga-sama?

00:18:09.890 --> 00:18:11.560
That would be treason.

00:18:20.760 --> 00:18:23.070
You will never achieve unification.

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:25.260
No,

00:18:26.050 --> 00:18:28.070
I will!

00:18:38.360 --> 00:18:40.900
Because I know the limits of my worth...

00:18:40.900 --> 00:18:42.460
Because I know there are 
things I cannot reach,

00:18:42.460 --> 00:18:43.670
I can continue to struggle.

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:45.920
Even vessels with a limited capacity

00:18:45.920 --> 00:18:49.890
can eventually fill an infinite void,
 if replenished often enough!

00:18:50.170 --> 00:18:51.960
That is my path...

00:18:52.600 --> 00:18:54.260
my way of life!

00:19:01.270 --> 00:19:03.500
Nobu... sama...

00:19:04.780 --> 00:19:05.850
Ichihime.

00:19:06.300 --> 00:19:08.480
I have finally found my path.

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:18.890
Nobunaga!

00:19:23.190 --> 00:19:24.350
Well done.

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:36.240
The Regalia?

00:19:38.980 --> 00:19:40.440
I thought this might be the case.

00:19:44.560 --> 00:19:45.650
Mitsu,

00:19:46.350 --> 00:19:49.650
the reason you could not wield a Regalia...

00:19:50.860 --> 00:19:53.270
...is because you weren't meant to do that.

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:55.320
You were meant to stop them.

00:20:03.210 --> 00:20:04.370
So...

00:20:04.930 --> 00:20:06.640
You did not devour the people.

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:07.870
You protected them?

00:20:08.460 --> 00:20:10.770
I thank you, Jeanne.

00:20:11.210 --> 00:20:14.240
I decided to live my life 
with the Destroyer-King,

00:20:15.220 --> 00:20:17.610
as one who will hold back destruction.

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:20.850
Then what you have devoured...

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:23.350
...is the power to create wars,

00:20:23.870 --> 00:20:25.070
and only that?

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:28.800
I am the Destroyer-King.

00:20:29.320 --> 00:20:31.390
Having devoured the power of destruction,

00:20:31.390 --> 00:20:33.390
I will now die with it.

00:20:34.300 --> 00:20:35.180
Nobu...

00:20:35.820 --> 00:20:38.660
The rest is up to you, Mitsu.

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:41.840
How will you shape the world?

00:20:42.280 --> 00:20:43.640
Do I...

00:20:43.920 --> 00:20:45.800
...have that right?

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:47.630
You killed Nobukatsu.

00:20:48.920 --> 00:20:51.240
Only one who has known boundless pain

00:20:51.960 --> 00:20:54.560
can create a world without pain.

00:20:55.090 --> 00:20:57.280
Do it for Nobukatsu and Ichi.

00:20:58.020 --> 00:20:59.600
Now, answer me.

00:21:00.240 --> 00:21:02.390
What is the world you truly desire?

00:21:03.440 --> 00:21:04.470
What do I...

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:07.130
What do I desire?

00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:11.330
Peace.

00:21:13.520 --> 00:21:17.170
There is no place for me, then.

00:21:18.160 --> 00:21:20.680
I only know how to destroy.

00:21:21.430 --> 00:21:23.180
After all...

00:21:23.730 --> 00:21:26.640
I prefer chaos.

00:21:24.520 --> 00:21:26.160
I prefer chaos.

00:21:27.280 --> 00:21:28.400
Nobunaga.

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:35.160
So the central figure was 
supposed to be Mitsuhide.

00:21:35.580 --> 00:21:37.820
He was the Savior-King.

00:21:37.820 --> 00:21:40.550
Nobunaga was Judas.

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:42.430
Oh?

00:21:43.600 --> 00:21:46.190
So it was in reverse.

00:21:46.650 --> 00:21:48.440
I have yet a lot to learn.

00:21:48.900 --> 00:21:50.460
What will you do now?

00:21:50.460 --> 00:21:57.140
Their souls do not deserve to be
 imprisoned within my abhorrent painting.

00:21:58.400 --> 00:22:00.020
Be freed.

00:22:00.020 --> 00:22:01.550
And live...

00:22:01.900 --> 00:22:03.320
in the new world.

00:22:03.580 --> 00:22:04.910
Da Vinci-san!

00:22:04.910 --> 00:22:09.220
I will always pursue its form...

00:22:12.550 --> 00:22:13.790
Can you hear that?

00:22:14.080 --> 00:22:16.360
Yes, I do.

00:22:17.000 --> 00:22:18.890
We will embark on a journey.

00:22:19.250 --> 00:22:20.970
We will surely meet again.

00:22:20.970 --> 00:22:22.160
You're right.

00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:24.850
Let us go together into a new world

00:22:25.190 --> 00:22:28.150
where chaos awaits us, Ranmaru.

00:22:28.680 --> 00:22:31.520
I'll follow you anywhere, my beloved.

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:33.500
It was inevitable.

00:22:39.890 --> 00:22:43.180
Dragon, are you returning to heaven?

00:22:55.480 --> 00:22:57.770
I knew Nobu-sama'd do it.

00:22:57.770 --> 00:23:00.810
He's the the greatest 
fool in the whole world.

00:23:00.810 --> 00:23:02.070
Mitsuhide-sama.

00:23:02.070 --> 00:23:03.440
We're so glad you're alive.

00:23:04.500 --> 00:23:05.530
Hideyoshi!

00:23:05.970 --> 00:23:07.050
Everyone.

00:23:10.590 --> 00:23:12.870
Nobu, I swear to you.

00:23:13.960 --> 00:23:17.030
I <i>will</i> create a world of peace!

00:23:17.730 --> 00:23:19.000
Knowing you,

00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:21.760
I know asking you to watch 
over me will be pointless.

00:23:22.420 --> 00:23:26.340
Just fly to wherever you will!
